{"seq":6,"slug":"role-career-paths","title":"蓝箭航天岗位与职业路径","docCount":5,"url":"/h/corporate-management/landspace/role-career-paths","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"engineering","title":"蓝箭航天工程师岗位路径全景","url":"/h/corporate-management/landspace/role-career-paths/engineering","wordCount":3524,"readingTime":15},{"seq":2,"slug":"propulsion-engineer","title":"推进系统工程师路径","url":"/h/corporate-management/landspace/role-career-paths/propulsion-engineer","wordCount":1420,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"manufacturing-assembly","title":"制造总装路径","url":"/h/corporate-management/landspace/role-career-paths/manufacturing-assembly","wordCount":1514,"readingTime":7},{"seq":4,"slug":"test-launch-ops","title":"测试与发射运营路径","url":"/h/corporate-management/landspace/role-career-paths/test-launch-ops","wordCount":1566,"readingTime":7},{"seq":5,"slug":"business-development","title":"商务拓展路径","url":"/h/corporate-management/landspace/role-career-paths/business-development","wordCount":1288,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 蓝箭航天岗位与职业路径\n\n本章详细梳理蓝箭航天的核心岗位族群与职业发展路径，覆盖工程师（推进/结构/航电/测试/制造/软件）、商务拓展等方向。蓝箭航天作为中国商业航天领跑者，其岗位体系围绕\"设计—制造—试验—发射—回收\"全生命周期构建。\n\n## 岗位族群全景\n\n- **推进系统**：液氧甲烷发动机设计、天鹊系列产品化\n- **结构设计**：不锈钢箭体、贮箱、级间段\n- **航电GNC**：制导导航控制、飞行软件、测控通信\n- **测试与发射**：地面试验、发射操作、回收运维\n- **制造工艺**：焊接、复材、总装、智能制造\n- **商务拓展**：卫星发射服务、政府/商业客户管理\n"}